				},
				{
					"id": 761310609,
					"content": "正在讀取基地工程藍圖與路線，嗯…向前進就能抵達。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310610,
					"content": "還有什麼其他情報嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310611
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310611,
					"content": "開始檢索其他資訊…嗯？「從星海間返回的漆黑之王」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310612,
					"content": "這是什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310613,
					"content": "資料顯示，這座基地的存在…源自那位「漆黑之王」的意志。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310614,
					"content": "它的建成時間，也比我們之前見過的設施要晚許多。它的底部通向月心，那裡被挖出了一道罅縫。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310615,
					"content": "源源不斷的古月之力從月心罅縫湧出，成為了基地的能源。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310616,
					"content": "它的目的，是將月球打造成…天基武器！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310617,
					"content": "天、天基武器？那難道那位「漆黑之王」是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310618,
					"content": "大概就是歸來的龍王尼伯龍根。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310619
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310619,
					"content": "是龍王回來了？！我們也太厲害了吧，這是闖到什麼地方來了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310620,
					"content": "天理來完龍王來，龍王來完我們來！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310621,
					"content": "向著星辰與深淵。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310622
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310622,
					"content": "這樣說的話…前面的路我們得打起十二分警惕了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310623,
					"content": "哥倫比婭，萬一有不對勁的事，妳要保護好我們啊…咦？哥倫比婭？哥倫比婭呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310624,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}！哥倫比婭不見了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310625,
					"content": "…是什麼時候？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310626
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310626,
					"content": "完全沒有感覺到…黑蛋，你看見哥倫比婭了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310627,
					"content": "沒有，我一直在讀取終端機裡的資訊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310628,
					"content": "糟、糟糕了啊…保護我們的人居然不見了！有鬼啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310629,
					"content": "（哥倫比婭絕對不會不告而別，一定有其他原因。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310630
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310630,
					"content": "（會和黑蛋有關嗎？不，她一直在讀取終端機的資訊。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310631
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310631,
					"content": "（那難道是…？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310632
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310632,
					"content": "而且站在這裡，那種奇怪的熟悉感更深了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310633
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310633,
					"content": "（看來哥倫比婭消失的原因和她所說的熟悉感有關，這座基地裡到底有什麼？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310634
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310634,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，我們現在該怎麼辦啊？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310635,
						761310637
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310635,
					"content": "去盧沙里姆的研究室。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310636
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310636,
					"content": "嗯，那裡一定有關於這座基地的秘密，或許也能找到關於哥倫比婭消失的線索。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310641
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310641,
					"content": "但我們的路線要經過前方的警戒設施，不能觸發基地的全面警報。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310642
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310642,
					"content": "有沒有辦法關閉這些警戒設施？讓我看看…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310643,
						761310645,
						761310647,
						761310649,
						761310651
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310643,
					"content": "觀察",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310644
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310644,
					"content": "那邊就是通向盧沙里姆研究室的路線，但我們要先想辦法關閉警戒設施。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310653
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310653,
					"content": "看起來，我們要先走左邊的房間上到二樓，那裡是警戒控制室。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310654
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310654,
					"content": "找個辦法，溜進去看看吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310645,
					"content": "觀察",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310646
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310646,
					"content": "這個房間好像可以通向二樓。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310653
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310647,
					"content": "觀察",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310648
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310648,
					"content": "工程藍圖顯示，左側二樓和右側二樓的房間是警戒控制室。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310653
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310649,
					"content": "觀察",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310650
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310650,
					"content": "好像已經崩塌了，沒有能通過的路。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310653
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310651,
					"content": "觀察",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310652
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310652,
					"content": "工程藍圖顯示，左側二樓和右側二樓的房間是警戒控制室。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310653
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310637,
					"content": "事已至此，先撤退吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310638
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310638,
					"content": "#我知道{F#妳}{M#你}是想開個玩笑要我別害怕…嗯…我要鼓起勇氣！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310639
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310639,
					"content": "我們要去找哥倫比婭，我們不會把她丟在這裡的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310640
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310640,
					"content": "我們應該去盧沙里姆的研究室。那裡一定有關於這座基地的秘密，或許也能找到關於哥倫比婭消失的線索。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310641
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				}
			]
		},
